      "description": "\u201cAuthorization policy lives in the document's own auth scope as replicated grants, so reducers carry no access-control code\u201d contradicts \u201cReducer-level RBAC gates operations on action.context.signer.user.address so access control replicates with the document\u201d. Opened automatically from a CONTRADICTS link \u2014 resolve if one side is right, dissolve if both hold in different contexts.",
